id=pico4_swift_force_enable
name=PICO 4 Motion Tracker Unlock (2.0.5)
version=v2.8.2
versionCode=14
author=wzy
description=PICO 4 Motion Tracker 2.0.5 unlock for PICO 4 standard (ROM 5.13.x). v2.8.2: the installer refuses to stack a second tracker module (old pico4_swift205_libpreload); v2.8 critical fix keeps native compat libs in the priv-app nativeLibraryDir so openxr_runtime never sees them. Stock PICO-signed APK untouched. Single build, stock scheduling. Tracker detection works (3 devices verified). Reboot after install.
